exports[`both feedback emails, every invitation case > reply: linked and in the community: switch only 1`] = `
{
  "html": "<!DOCTYPE html><html><body style="margin:0;background:#f3f4f6;padding:24px 12px;">
  <div style="font-family:-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#1f2937;font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word;background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:12px;padding:28px 28px 24px;">
    <p style="margin:0 0 16px;">Hi Sam,</p>
    <p style="margin:0 0 4px;color:#6b7280;font-size:13px;">You reported:</p>
       <blockquote style="margin:0 0 18px;padding:10px 16px;border-left:3px solid #c7b8a6;background:#f6f3ee;color:#374151;border-radius:0 6px 6px 0;white-space:pre-wrap;">Some of my files won't upload; it says there was an internal error.</blockquote>
    <p style="margin:0 0 14px;">Thanks, we're raising the limit and making the error say why.</p>
    <p style="margin:18px 0 10px;font-weight:600;">Want faster answers?</p><p style="margin:0 0 14px;">&bull; You've connected Discord, so these replies can come there instead of by email: <a href="https://app.example.test/me/communication#platform.feedback.replied" style="color:#8a6f47;">switch feedback replies to Discord</a>.</p>
    <p style="margin:22px 0 8px;"><a href="https://app.example.test/me/feedback" style="display:inline-block;background:#8a6f47;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;font-size:14px;padding:10px 18px;border-radius:8px;">Open your feedback</a></p>
    <p style="margin:14px 0 0;color:#6b7280;font-size:12px;">Reply to this email to answer, or use your feedback page.</p>
    <p style="margin:18px 0 0;color:#6b7280;font-size:12px;">The Cobblr team</p>
  </div></body></html>",
  "subject": "We replied to your Cobblr feedback",
  "text": "Hi Sam,

Thanks, we're raising the limit and making the error say why.

Want faster answers?
• You've connected Discord, so these replies can come there instead of by email: switch feedback replies to Discord (https://app.example.test/me/communication#platform.feedback.replied).

Just reply to this email and it'll land on your report — or use your feedback page:
  https://app.example.test/me/feedback

You'd sent us:
  "Some of my files won't upload; it says there was an internal error."

The Cobblr team",
}
`;

